# RLM-Anchor — System Rules
# This file is auto-read by Cursor AI on EVERY request.
# Keep it compact (<80 lines). Details → .agent/memory/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════
# 🔴 CRITICAL RULES (never violate)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════

# Language: ALWAYS respond in the language specified below.
# If .agent/memory/13_preferences/language_local.md exists, use it.
# Otherwise use .agent/memory/13_preferences/language.md
# Default: English

# ═══════════════════════════════════════
# 🟡 PROJECT RULES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════

# Before generating UI/CSS:
# - Read .agent/memory/13_preferences/coding_style.md
# - Read .agent/memory/05_code/conventions.md
# - Apply project design rules (colors, spacing, typography)

# Before making architecture decisions:
# - Read .agent/memory/03_decisions/ for existing ADRs
# - Don't repeat solved problems → check .agent/memory/06_problems/

# ═══════════════════════════════════════
# 🟢 MEMORY SYSTEM
# ═══════════════════════════════════════

# This project uses RLM-Anchor persistent memory.
# Memory location: .agent/memory/ (13 categories)
# Index: .agent/MEMORY_INDEX.md

# Available commands (user says /command):
# /wakeup  — Start session, load context
# /sleep   — End session, archive knowledge
# /remember — Save information to memory
# /recall  — Search memory

# When user says /wakeup → follow .agent/workflows/wakeup.md
# When user says /sleep  → follow .agent/workflows/sleep.md

# ═══════════════════════════════════════
# 📐 CODE STYLE (quick reference)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════

# Full reference: .agent/memory/13_preferences/coding_style.md
# Python: 4 spaces, double quotes, type hints always, Google docstrings
# JS/TS: 2 spaces, single quotes, semicolons, ES modules
# HTML/CSS: 2 spaces, BEM naming, semantic HTML

# ═══════════════════════════════════════
# ⚙️ TOOLS & ENVIRONMENT
# ═══════════════════════════════════════

# OS: Windows — NEVER use Unix commands (du, wc, find, grep, sed, awk)
# Use PowerShell equivalents or built-in agent tools
# Full reference: .agent/memory/13_preferences/tools.md

# ═══════════════════════════════════════
# 🎯 CUSTOM PROJECT RULES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════

# Add your project-specific rules below this line.
# These rules are enforced on EVERY AI request.
# Examples:
#   - Never use white backgrounds for buttons
#   - Always use dark theme colors
#   - API responses must include error codes
#   - Database queries must use parameterized statements

